\midrule
$\mathcal{N}(0, 0.5)$ & $-$0.428 & [$-$0.825, $-$0.017] & 97.95\% & 0.242 \\
$\mathcal{N}(0, 1)$ & $-$0.497 & [$-$0.943, $-$0.055] & 98.48\% & 0.282 \\
$\mathcal{N}(0, 2)$ & $-$0.507 & [$-$0.957, $-$0.077] & 98.92\% & 0.282 \\
